1
00:00:00,632 --> 00:00:02,712
(Raj:)Excuse me. Oh, it's my assistant, Trevor.

2
00:00:02,884 --> 00:00:04,514
(Raj:)Go for Koothrappali. Uh-huh.

3
00:00:04,928 --> 00:00:06,508
(Howard:)They gave him an assistant?

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:10,600
(Howard:)If I want a new pen,
I have to go to the bank with wire cutters.

5
00:00:11,309 --> 00:00:13,559
(Sheldon(still smiling):)Have we at this point
met our social obligations?

6
00:00:13,728 --> 00:00:14,808
(Leonard:)Not yet.

7
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:18,400
Okay, put it on my calendar, but start
thinking of a reason why I can't go.

8
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:21,067
(Raj:)Alrighty? Koothrappali out.

9
00:00:21,319 --> 00:00:22,359
(Raj:)God bless that boy.

10
00:00:22,529 --> 00:00:25,779
(Raj:)- Don't know what I'd do without him.
- You just got him this afternoon.

11
00:00:25,949 --> 00:00:28,949
(Raj:)Yes, but I'm finding
that having a lackey suits me.

12
00:00:29,911 --> 00:00:32,331
- A lackey?
- I'm sorry, is that politically incorrect?

13
00:00:32,497 --> 00:00:35,167
(Raj:)In India, we just call them untouchables.

14
00:00:36,126 --> 00:00:38,206
- Now?
- Almost.

15
00:00:38,378 --> 00:00:41,468
(Raj:)Speaking of untouchables,
I've got great news for you guys.

16
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,340
(Raj:)People magazine is having a reception
Saturday, and I managed to get you invited.

17
00:00:47,512 --> 00:00:50,052
- Oh, gee, thanks.
- Oh, you're welcome.

18
00:00:50,223 --> 00:00:52,683
(Raj:)Of course, I couldn't get you
into the VIP section...

19
00:00:52,851 --> 00:00:57,851
(Raj:)...because, you know, that's for VIPs,
and you guys are just, you know, P's.

20
00:00:59,107 --> 00:01:01,317
(Sheldon:)There's a tribe in Papua New Guinea...

